# Copy to ~/vigie/web.env on the server (deploy.sh files does it once, then leaves it alone).
# The address visitors use. Before the site is public, the SSH tunnel's (README.md); then https://<name>.
ORIGIN=http://localhost:8090
# Optional: keep the weather of the places the server knows warm, so that their first opening is quick (docs/configuration.md,
# "Warming the known places"; up to 103 requests a day to the API for each cell, 20 cells at most unless changed).
#VIGIE_WARM_PLACES=1
#VIGIE_WARM_MAX_CELLS=20
#VIGIE_WARM_LOOKUPS_PER_DAY=2200
